            <content type="1" mime_type="content/term" content_visibility="true" file_name=""><![CDATA[The perimeter of a triangle is equal to the sum of all its sides.]]></content>
        </node>
        <node type="node/const/perm/general" idtf="" shapeColor="0" id="5125288000" parent="0" x="623.133" y="3140.61" haveBus="false" idtf_pos="0">
            <content type="1" mime_type="content/term" content_visibility="true" file_name=""><![CDATA[Периметр треугольника равен сумме всех сторон.]]></content>
        </node>
        <node type="node/const/perm/general" idtf="" shapeColor="0" id="4643878880" parent="0" x="451.686" y="2533.79" haveBus="false" idtf_pos="0">
            <content type="1" mime_type="content/term" content_visibility="true" file_name=""><![CDATA[If the altitude of a triangle is the median, then the triangle is isosceles.]]></content>
        </node>
        <node type="node/const/perm/general" idtf="" shapeColor="0" id="4643670320" parent="0" x="669.44" y="2538.92" haveBus="false" idtf_pos="0">
            <content type="1" mime_type="content/term" content_visibility="true" file_name=""><![CDATA[Если в треугольнике высота является медианой, то треугольник равнобедренный.]]></content>
        </node>
        <node type="node/const/perm/general" idtf="" shapeColor="0" id="4643423072" parent="0" x="451.7" y="2004.09" haveBus="false" idtf_pos="0">
            <content type="1" mime_type="content/term" content_visibility="true" file_name=""><![CDATA[In an isosceles triangle, the bisector drawn to the base is the median and the altitude.]]></content>
        </node>
        <node type="node/const/perm/general" idtf="" shapeColor="0" id="4680124336" parent="0" x="669.454" y="2007.63" haveBus="false" idtf_pos="0">
            <content type="1" mime_type="content/term" content_visibility="true" file_name=""><![CDATA[В равнобедренном треугольнике биссектриса, проведенная к основанию, является медианой и высотой.]]></content>
        </node>
        <node type="node/const/perm/general" idtf="" shapeColor="0" id="4606040176" parent="0" x="494.345" y="1508.17" haveBus="false" idtf_pos="0">
            <content type="1" mime_type="content/term" content_visibility="true" file_name=""><![CDATA[If the altitude of a triangle is a bisector, then the triangle is isosceles.]]></content>
